<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Provenance annotation identifying the vocabulary, standard, or ontology from which a class, property, or named individual of this ontology aligns with. \nPossible values: \"LCA ontology\" (introduced by this ontology, no direct external counterpart), \"ILCD base\" (corresponds to the ILCD base data format), \"ILCD+EPD extension\" (corresponds to the ILCD+EPD v1.3 extension, InData epd/epd2/epd24 namespaces), \"Dublin Core\" (aligned with dcterms), \"PROV-O\" (aligned with W3C Provenance Ontology), \"SKOS\" (aligned with W3C Simple Knowledge Organization System), \"FOAF\" (aligned with Friend of a Friend vocabulary), \"LCAnet\" (aligned with the LCAnet ontology)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "source vocabulary"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
