<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Human-readable label of the unit in which the associated EN 15804 indicator value is expressed, e.g. \"kg CO2-eq\", \"MJ, net calorific value\", \"m3\". Annotation property (not for automated unit arithmetic)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "unit as string"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "LCA ontology"@en .
