<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LCAModuleValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One numerical LCA-result value (impact or inventory-indicator) for a specific EN 15804+A2 life-cycle module (A1-A3, A4, ..., D) and optionally a specific scenario. \nIt carries eudpp:amount (the numeric value), eudpp:forLifeCycleModule, optionally eudpp:forScenario, and eudpp:isDeclared (boolean: true if the module is declared with this value; false if the module is explicitly not declared for this indicator)."@en .
