<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LandUseResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#InventoryIndicatorResult> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LandUseResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An LCA result quantifying impacts associated with land occupation and transformation in a product system. \nCommonly associated with the EN 15804+A2 land use indicator (LU), which is characterised under EF 3.1. No formal quantifiesIndicator restriction is imposed; note that LU sits at the boundary between inventory and impact in EN 15804 and may be refined in future ontology versions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#LandUseResult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Land Use Result"@en .
