<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_ADPF> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceVocabulary> "ILCD+EPD extension" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_ADPF> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#unitAsString> "MJ, net calorific value"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_ADPF> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA#relatesToLCAIndicator> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ind_EF_resourceUseFossils> .
